@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
    - studentId : String
    + viewAvailability(date : Date)
    + bookRoom(room : Room, startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : Booking
    + cancelBooking(booking : Booking)
}

class Administrator {
    - adminId : String
    + blockRoom(room : Room)
    + unblockRoom(room : Room)
    + reviewRoomUsage(startDate : Date, endDate : Date)
}

class Room {
    - roomId : String
    - isBlocked : boolean
    + isAvailable(startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : boolean
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId : String
    - startTime : DateTime
    - endTime : DateTime
    - status : BookingStatus
    + cancel()
}

enum BookingStatus {
    CONFIRMED
    CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for >


note right of Booking
  R1: Start must be in the future.
  Duration must be > 0 and <= 2 hours.

  R2: Active bookings for the same
  room cannot overlap.

  US-04: A student can cancel only
  their own booking.

  Assumption: CONFIRMED bookings
  are considered active for R2.
end note

note right of Room
  R3: A blocked room cannot accept
  a new booking.
end note

' Assumption A1:
' Each booking belongs to exactly one student.

' Assumption A2:
' Each booking reserves exactly one room.

' Assumption A3:
' BookingStatus is used to distinguish
' active and cancelled bookings.

@enduml